1116
01:51:21,730 --> 01:51:32,910
Twilight glistens, floating down to my window,

1117
01:51:36,450 --> 01:51:43,740
I breathe in the twinkling wind

1118
01:51:43,740 --> 01:51:49,300
When I look at the sky.

1119
